(7189023, 1105513, 54446, '<td valign="top">A very nice image.  Good selective focus.  However, your title says ...Deep DOF....  It''s definitely not!  All good, except for that title mistake.</td>', 'A very nice image.  Good selective focus.  However, your title says ...Deep DOF....  It''s definitely not!  All good, except for that title mistake.', '2014-03-12 10:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
