(7191113, 1105604, 124190, '<td valign="top">Like an old antique doll who''s lost her glass eyes.  Disconcerting.  This asks for closer examination whereupon one can see the square edges of your processing.   If you want it looking creepier, use a round editing brush to smooth the lines.....or even a little blur tool along the edges?    You probably enjoyed doing this for some reason.  Poor girl....burned out....:-(</td>', 'Like an old antique doll who''s lost her glass eyes.  Disconcerting.  This asks for closer examination whereupon one can see the square edges of your processing.   If you want it looking creepier, use a round editing brush to smooth the lines.....or even a little blur tool along the edges?    You probably enjoyed doing this for some reason.  Poor girl....burned out....:-(', '2014-03-18 07:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
